      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-20",
      "text": "白晶晶大喊“牛魔王！”，海水灌进她嘴里，水中附着龙王的魔咒，几条火龙向她射来。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0147/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0147"
      },
      "revealed_at": 59,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000059.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000059",
          "chapter_order": 59,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "海水灌进了她嘴里"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-21",
      "text": "一股力量把白晶晶提出了水面。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 59,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000059.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000059",
          "chapter_order": 59,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "一股力量把她提出了水面"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-22",
      "text": "牛魔王问白晶晶是哪个部族的，说她不是挑选出来的妖军、这点修行也敢待在这儿、碍手碍脚。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0037/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0037"
      },
      "revealed_at": 59,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000059.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000059",
          "chapter_order": 59,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "你是哪个部族的"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-23",
      "text": "白晶晶对牛魔王说“我不是妖精，我是仙……现在不是了”，并说自己没有地方可去了。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0147/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0147"
      },
      "revealed_at": 59,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000059.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000059",
          "chapter_order": 59,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我是仙……现在不是了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-24",
      "text": "牛魔王说白晶晶很聪明、知道来花果山，这是极乐园，但她来得不是时候；现在是海风季节，每隔几年就要来一次，风暴过去后一切还会长出来。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0037/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0037"
      },
      "revealed_at": 59,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000059.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000059",
          "chapter_order": 59,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "现在是海风季节"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-25",
      "text": "白晶晶说这里要沉了、神的力量无法抗拒，并说妖族永远也掌握不了这么大的力量。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0147/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0147"
      },
      "revealed_at": 59,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000059.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000059",
          "chapter_order": 59,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "妖族永远也掌握不了这么大的力量"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-26",
      "text": "牛魔王说妖族总是自然的顺从者，在海水、泥土、落叶中而生，不会想到控制天地力量、把风雨雷电据为己用，但妖族并不是没有令人畏惧的力量。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0037/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0037"
      },
      "revealed_at": 59,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000059.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000059",
          "chapter_order": 59,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我们总是自然的顺从者"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-27",
      "text": "天地间闪过巨大电光后，牛魔王向下俯冲，数十道闪电在他身边掠过，他左右横晃在闪电中穿梭；头顶黑云膨胀炸出几百里宽的巨大火球，爆炸收缩的气浪把地上大石吸上天。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0037/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0037"
      },
      "revealed_at": 59,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000059.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000059",
          "chapter_order": 59,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "他向下俯冲下去"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-28",
      "text": "天地忽然静下来后，一道红光贯穿满天黑云、一连串巨响从东炸到西；牛魔王落在乱石纵横的地面上长出一口气，北方铁铸的黑云后传来天兵的喊杀声。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 59,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000059.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000059",
          "chapter_order": 59,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "牛魔王落在乱石纵横的地面上"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-29",
      "text": "牛魔王指向天际说“是他，看哪。”“他在战斗。”",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0037/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0037"
      },
      "revealed_at": 59,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000059.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000059",
          "chapter_order": 59,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "牛魔王指向天际"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-30",
      "text": "一道巨大电光把云层映亮，云涛上映出一个巨大的舞动兵器的身影，地上的人惊叹。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 59,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000059.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000059",
          "chapter_order": 59,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "一个巨大的舞动兵器的身影被映在滚滚云涛上"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-31",
      "text": "牛魔王学着云中身影摆姿势，自嘲“我永远都做不到他的造型那么帅”，白晶晶笑起来。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0037/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0037"
      },
      "revealed_at": 59,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000059.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000059",
          "chapter_order": 59,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我永远都做不到他的造型那么帅"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-32",
      "text": "叙述以白晶晶第一人称自述：她知道自己答应过会等他回来，因为傻、不肯放弃而成为妖精；漫长等待中风吹散头发、吹朽皮肤、吹化身体，只剩下一个等待的姿势，用没有眼球的黑洞望向天涯。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0147/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0147"
      },
      "revealed_at": 59,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000059.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000059",
          "chapter_order": 59,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "只剩下一个等待的姿势"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-33",
      "text": "白晶晶的自述中追问“他”是否真的已倒在这世界的某一个角落，或者已不再记得这世上的某一个地方是家。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0147/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0147"
      },
      "revealed_at": 59,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000059.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000059",
          "chapter_order": 59,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "他真的已倒在这世界的某一个角落"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-34",
      "text": "在黑松林没有月光的夜里，白晶晶沉浸在回忆里，喃喃念“孙悟空……”，脸上的笑容渐渐消失。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0147/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0147"
      },
      "revealed_at": 59,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000059.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000059",
          "chapter_order": 59,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "在黑松林没有月光的夜里"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-35",
      "text": "白晶晶说“孙悟空。这样的一个人怎么能被铁箍拘束！绝不！”。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0147/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0147"
      },
      "revealed_at": 59,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000059.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000059",
          "chapter_order": 59,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "怎么能被铁箍拘束"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-36",
      "text": "白晶晶走上高岩，夜风吹动她的衣衫，月光从云中露出，照见她可怖的原形。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
